    "title": "Del Taco - Del Yeah! Rewards",
    "description": "Introducing Del Yeah! Rewards, an all new app experience for Del Taco guests. Get more rewards more often and earn points on your visits to Del to redeem for your Del Faves. New features in this app include:\r\n- Earn rewards points on purchases instore and online and level up to show off your Del Yeah! tier\r\n- A robust rewards menu with items starting at just 250 points\r\n- An enhanced ordering experience, to customize and order your Del faves ahead for Pickup, Drive-thru, Delivery, or Park & Get it (where available)\r\n- Personalized offers and content\r\n- Del Yeah! exclusive content and opportunities",
